cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "CoFFE — A Compact In-Domain Fusion Encoder versus a Hyperspectral Foundation Model for Few-Shot HSI-LiDAR Land-Cover Classification"
abstract: >-
  Public code release for the paper. Compares a 579K-parameter per-scene
  self-supervised HSI+LiDAR fusion encoder (CoFFE) against the HyperSIGMA
  hyperspectral foundation model and an MFT architectural control, all under one
  frozen-encoder 5-shot N-way Euclidean nearest-class-mean protocol on Houston
  2013, Trento and MUUFL Gulfport.
